&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ship the full experience.&lt;/strong&gt; Build in-product chat, streaming responses, permission-aware APIs, and our external MCP server&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make quality measurable.&lt;/strong&gt; Build evals, catch regressions, and use production feedback to improve quality, latency, and cost&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help shape the platform.&lt;/strong&gt; Make decisions about how we build, deploy, and run agents as the product grows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
