&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Budgeting &amp;amp; forecasting:&lt;/strong&gt; lead the annual budget, monthly reforecasts and long-range plan. Own the planning calendar, key assumptions and models, and consolidate inputs from regional and functional stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Margin management:&lt;/strong&gt; own margin analysis at every level (channel, market, category, collection, SKU), including markdowns, promotions, cost of goods, freight, duties, FX and inventory provisions. Build margin bridges, explain variances and drive recommendations on pricing and markdown strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Monthly close &amp;amp; reporting:&lt;/strong&gt; own the FP&amp;amp;A month-end close and the global management reporting package (actuals vs. budget, forecast and prior year, variance commentary, KPI dashboards). Work with Accounting to ensure management and statutory figures reconcile.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business partnering:&lt;/strong&gt; serve as finance partner to Retail, E-Commerce, Wholesale, Merchandising and Supply Chain leaders on store P&amp;amp;Ls, inventory productivity and open-to-buy, pricing, promotional plans, and business cases for store openings and market entries.&lt;/li&gt;
